{
  "title": { "zh": "子句化" },
  "adds": ["toClauses", "skolem"],
  "tray": "machine",
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "新元件「析出子句」把目标是 ⊥ 的证明状态拆开，每一串「或者」一条<wiki-ref to=\"clause\"></wiki-ref>：从这里起，线上传的是子句，不再是证明状态。"
      }
    }
  ],
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "au-clauses",
      "kind": "machine",
      "want": "clauses",
      "inputs": [{ "name": "in", "label": { "zh": "目标" } }],
      "backtrack": true,
      "tests": [
        { "goal": "Wet", "hyps": ["Rain → Wet", "Rain"], "clauses": ["¬Rain ∨ Wet", "Rain", "¬Wet"] },
        {
          "goal": "OnTime",
          "hyps": ["Bus ∨ Bike", "Bus → OnTime", "Bike → OnTime"],
          "clauses": ["Bus ∨ Bike", "¬Bus ∨ OnTime", "¬Bike ∨ OnTime", "¬OnTime"]
        },
        {
          "goal": "Mortal(h)",
          "hyps": ["∀x. Human(x) → Mortal(x)", "Human(h)"],
          "clauses": ["¬Human(x) ∨ Mortal(x)", "Human(h)", "¬Mortal(h)"]
        },
        {
          "goal": "∀x. Baby(x) → ¬Tamer(x)",
          "hyps": ["∀x. Baby(x) → ¬Logical(x)"],
          "clauses": ["¬Baby(x) ∨ ¬Logical(x)", "Baby(a)", "Tamer(a)"]
        }
      ],
      "brief": {
        "zh": "设计一个证明助手，把每个目标拆成子句：要证的那句的否定和已知一起。"
      },
      "hint": [
        { "zh": "本章前面几关的步骤，依次接上。" },
        {
          "zh": "<level-ref to=\"au-negate\"></level-ref>、<level-ref to=\"au-hyps\"></level-ref>、<level-ref to=\"au-skolem\"></level-ref>，最后「析出子句」。"
        }
      ],
      "solution": [
        "c0r0 = raa()",
        "c1r0 = impI()",
        "c2r0 = iff[use=[\"iff.elim\"]]()",
        "c0 = rule(in, c0r0)",
        "c2r1 = arrow[use=[\"arrow.elim\"]](c2r0)",
        "c1 = rule(c0, c1r0)",
        "c2r2 = dneg[use=[\"dneg.elim\"]](c2r1)",
        "c2r3 = dm[use=[\"dm.notOr\", \"dm.notAnd\", \"dm.notEx\", \"dm.notAll\"]](c2r2)",
        "c2r7 = dist[use=[\"dist.orAndR\", \"dist.orAndL\"]](c2r3)",
        "c2 = simp[at=hyps](c1, c2r7)",
        "c3 = skolem(c2)",
        "c4 = toClauses(c3)",
        "out <- c4"
      ],
      "naive": [
        "c0r0 = iff[use=[\"iff.elim\"]]()",
        "c0r1 = arrow[use=[\"arrow.elim\"]](c0r0)",
        "c0r2 = dneg[use=[\"dneg.elim\"]](c0r1)",
        "c0r3 = dm[use=[\"dm.notOr\", \"dm.notAnd\", \"dm.notEx\", \"dm.notAll\"]](c0r2)",
        "c0r7 = dist[use=[\"dist.orAndR\", \"dist.orAndL\"]](c0r3)",
        "c0 = simp[at=hyps](in, c0r7)",
        "c1 = skolem(c0)",
        "c2 = toClauses(c1)",
        "out <- c2"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
